#: users/templates/mail/application_received.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Thank you for applying for membership!\n"
"\n"
"We will check your application and get back to you after your application has\n"
"been processed.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, we recommend that you join our communication channels (Matrix and email list).\n"
"\n"
"Be sure to also read the membership guide in the wiki: %(wikiurl)s\n"
"\n"
"You should have received an e-mail link to create a password for our membership\n"
"management system. Please login and check your membership status: %(siteurl)s\n"
"\n"
"All %(sitename)s services work by voluntary basis so\n"
"things might not always work. Please be patient! If you see something \n"
"that could use improvement we would be very grateful for your contribution.\n"
"\n"
"Welcome!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kiitos jäsenhakemuksestasi!\n"
"\n"
"Käymme hakemuksesi läpi ja otamme yhteyttä kun hakemuksesi on käsitelty.\n"
"\n"
"Tällä aikaa voit vierailla labilla avointen ovien aikana ja liittyä viestintäkanavillemme (Matrix ja sähköpostilista).\n"
"\n"
"Nyt on myös hyvä hetki lueskella jäsenen ohje sivu wikistä: %(wikiurl)s\n"
"\n"
"Sinulle on lähetetty linkki jonka kautta voit luoda salasanasi labin\n"
"jäsenyydenhallintapalveluun. Kirjaudu järjestelmään niin pääset tarkistamaan jäsenyyden tilasi: %(siteurl)s\n"
"\n"
"Kaikki %(sitename)s palvelut on tuotettu vapaaehtoispohjalta, joten\n"
"kaikki ei aina toimi odotetusti. Pyydämme kärsivällisyyttä! Jos havaitset jotain\n"
"parannettavaa, otamme kiitollisena vastaan kontribuutioita.\n"
"\n"
"Tervetuloa!\n"

#: users/templates/mail/application_rejected.txt
msgid "Your application has been rejected."
msgstr "Hakemuksesi on hylätty."

#: users/templates/mail/door_access_denied.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi %(first_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"We noticed that you tried to access the door by using %(method)s to open it.\n"
"\n"
"Your account does not currently have access to the door.\n"
"\n"
"Please check your access status by logging into the member service.\n"
"\n"
"%(siteurl)s\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hei %(first_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"Yritit avata oven metodilla %(method)s.\n"
"\n"
"Käyttäjätililläsi ei ole tällähetkellä pääsyä oveen.\n"
"\n"
"Voit tarkistaa statuksesi kirjautumalla jäsenhallintaan.\n"
"\n"
"%(siteurl)s\n"

#: users/templates/mail/door_access_denied.txt
msgid "Your services status:"
msgstr "Palveluitesi tila:"

#: users/templates/mail/door_access_denied.txt
msgid "No services"
msgstr "Ei palveluja"

#: users/templates/mail/new_application.txt
msgid "New membership application"
msgstr "Uusi jäsenhakemus vastaanotettu"

#: users/templates/mail/service_subscription_about_to_expire.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi %(name)s\n"
"\n"
"Our records indicate that your subscription %(service_name)s is about to expire on %(paid_until)s.\n"
"\n"
"If you have just paid for these services you can disregard this email.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Hei %(name)s\n"
"\n"
"Kirjanpito huomasi että palvelusi %(service_name)s on vanhenemassa %(paid_until)s.\n"
"\n"
"Jos olet juuri maksanut voit poistaa tämän viestin\n"
"\n"
"Kiitos!\n"

#: users/templates/mail/welcome_and_next_steps.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Welcome aboard, %(first_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"Your membership application has been approved. Great to have you onboard! \n"
"\n"
"Now is the time to login to %(siteurl)s and check your payment information and status.\n"
"\n"
"If you have not yet read the new members' guide please do so now: %(wikiurl)s\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Tervetuloa mukaan %(first_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"Jäsenhakemuksesi on hyväksytty. Hienoa, että olet mukana!\n"
"\n"
"Nyt on aika kirjautua sisään %(siteurl)s ja tarkistaa maksutietosi ja tilasi.\n"
"\n"
"Jos et ole vielä lukenut uusien jäsenten opasta, tee se nyt: %(wikiurl)s\n"

#: users/templates/mail/welcome_and_next_steps.txt
msgid "Your services"
msgstr "Jäsenpalvelusi"

#: users/templates/mail/welcome_and_next_steps.txt
msgid "Reference number"
msgstr "Viitenumero"

#: users/templates/mail/welcome_and_next_steps.txt
msgid "Door opening number"
msgstr "Ovenavaus numero"

#: users/templates/mail/welcome_and_next_steps.txt
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"All %(sitename)s services work by voluntary basis so\n"
"things might not always work. Please be patient! If you see something \n"
"that could use improvement we would be very grateful for your contribution.\n"
"\n"
"Welcome!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kaikki %(sitename)s palvelut toimivat vapaaehtoisvoimin\n"
"asiat eivät välttämättä aina toimi. Ole kärsivällinen! Jos näet jotain\n"
"jossa olisi parantamisen varaa, olisimme hyvin kiitollisia panoksestasi.\n"
"\n"
"Tervetuloa!\n"

